{"task_id": "HumanEval/50", "solution": "def encode_shift(s: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns encoded string by shifting each lowercase English alphabet character by 5.\n    Non-alphabetic characters are passed through unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    encoded_chars = []\n    for ch in s:\n        if 'a' <= ch <= 'z':\n            shifted_pos = (ord(ch) - ord('a') + 5) % 26\n            encoded_chars.append(chr(shifted_pos + ord('a')))\n        else:\n            encoded_chars.append(ch)\n    return \"\".join(encoded_chars)\n\n\ndef decode_shift(s: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    Decodes a string previously encoded by encode_shift, reversing the character shift.\n    Non-alphabetic characters are passed through unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    decoded_chars = []\n    for ch in s:\n        if 'a' <= ch <= 'z':\n            original_pos = (ord(ch) - ord('a') - 5 + 26) % 26\n            decoded_chars.append(chr(original_pos + ord('a')))\n        else:\n            decoded_chars.append(ch)\n    return \"\".join(decoded_chars)"}
