{"task_id": "HumanEval/84", "solution": "```python\ndef solve(N):\n    \"\"\"Given a positive integer N, return the total sum of its digits in binary.\n    N is within the specified range [0, 10000].\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_of_digits = 0\n    # Convert the number to a string to iterate through its decimal digits.\n    for digit_char in str(N):\n        sum_of_digits += int(digit_char)\n\n    if sum_of_digits == 0:\n        return \"0\"\n    \n    # Convert the sum of digits to its binary string representation.\n    # The `bin()` function returns a string prefixed with \"0b\", which is removed.\n    binary_string = bin(sum_of_digits)[2:]\n    \n    return binary_string\n```"}
