{"task_id": "HumanEval/136", "solution": "```python\ndef largest_smallest_integers(lst):\n    '''\n    Finds the largest negative and smallest positive integers in a list.\n    Returns (largest_negative, smallest_positive) or None if not found.\n    '''\n    largest_neg = None\n    smallest_pos = None\n\n    for num in lst:\n        if num < 0:\n            if largest_neg is None or num > largest_neg:\n                largest_neg = num\n        elif num > 0:\n            if smallest_pos is None or num < smallest_pos:\n                smallest_pos = num\n        \n    return (largest_neg, smallest_pos)\n```"}
