{"task_id": "HumanEval/139", "solution": "def special_factorial(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the special factorial of a positive integer n, defined as n! * (n-1)! * ... * 1!. For example, special_factorial(4) returns 288.\"\"\"\n\n    def _factorial(k):\n        if k == 0:\n            return 1\n        res = 1\n        for i in range(1, k + 1):\n            res *= i\n        return res\n\n    special_fact_result = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        special_fact_result *= _factorial(i)\n    return special_fact_result"}
